+        
+          .. code:: bash
+        
+             [sudo] pip install -t lib --ignore-installed google-endpoints
+        
+        
+        Python Versions
+        ---------------
+        
+        google-endpoints is currently tested with Python 2.7.
+        
+        
+        Contributing
+        ------------
